  "steps": [
    "Preheat oven to 425°F (220°C). Toss sweet potato cubes with oil and spices. Roast on a sheet pan for 30–35 minutes until fork-tender.",
    "Heat olive oil in a skillet over medium heat. Cook onion and green pepper 3–5 minutes until softened. Add garlic and jalapeño; cook 1 minute.",
    "Add black beans with their liquid and spices. Simmer briefly, then mash to desired consistency. Season with salt and pepper.",
    "Stir lime juice, cilantro, and salt into cooked rice.",
    "Assemble bowls with rice, roasted sweet potatoes, and refried beans. Add desired toppings and serve with chips or tortillas."
